<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="Yn1QK" id="Yn1QK" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8ca57b67" id="u8ca57b67">🌟</span><span data-lake-id="ueed5e7f7" id="ueed5e7f7"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤-𝐑𝟏: 𝐈𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐢𝐳𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐂𝐚𝐩𝐚𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐢𝐧 𝐋𝐋𝐌𝐬 𝐯𝐢𝐚 𝐑𝐞𝐢𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐜𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ub2369c0d" id="ub2369c0d"><span data-lake-id="u8dc05e2e" id="u8dc05e2e">推理能力是人类智能的基石，使数学问题求解、逻辑推导和编程等复杂认知任务得以实现。人工智能领域的最新进展表明，当模型规模扩大到足够程度时，大语言模型能够表现出包括推理能力在内的涌现行为。然而，在预训练阶段获得此类能力通常需要大量计算资源</span></p><ul list="uf134e0b2"><li fid="uc44af547" data-lake-id="ucc2beeb7" id="ucc2beeb7"><span data-lake-id="uf80f764b" id="uf80f764b">另一条互补的研究路线表明，通过思维链提示，可以有效增强大语言模型的能力。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u32a940ee" id="u32a940ee">这一技术通过提供精心设计的少样本示例，或使用“Let’s think step by step”（逐步思考）等简短提示，使模型生成中间推理步骤，从而显著提升其在复杂任务上的表现</span></strong></li><li fid="uc44af547" data-lake-id="u134cf05b" id="u134cf05b"><span data-lake-id="ub3814cb0" id="ub3814cb0">同样，当模型在后训练阶段学习高质量的多步推理轨迹时，其性能也会进一步提高。尽管这些方法有效，但仍存在明显局限。它们依赖人工标注的推理轨迹，这既限制可扩展性，也引入认知偏差。此外，由于这些方法将模型限制为复现人类的思维过程，其性能本质上受到人类所提供示例的约束，从而无法探索更优的、不同于人类思维方式的推理路径</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7f825b17" id="u7f825b17"><strong><span data-lake-id="u57ee1490" id="u57ee1490" style="color: #DF2A3F">为解决上述问题，作者旨在探索大语言模型在强化学习框架下通过自我演化发展推理能力的潜力，并尽可能减少对人工标注的依赖</span></strong></p><ul list="uee64cad4"><li fid="uf21b2fc8" data-lake-id="ubac70373" id="ubac70373"><span data-lake-id="u565ff05c" id="u565ff05c">具体而言，作者以 DeepSeek-V3-Base 为基础，采用组相对策略优化作为强化学习框架。奖励信号仅依据最终预测结果相对于标准答案的正确性，不对推理过程本身施加约束</span></li><li fid="uf21b2fc8" data-lake-id="ude639b0e" id="ude639b0e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u52552315" id="u52552315" style="color: #5C0036">值得注意的是，作者跳过强化学习训练之前通常采用的监督微调阶段。这一设计选择源于以下假设：人类定义的推理模式可能限制模型的探索，而不受约束的强化学习训练能够更好地激励大语言模型涌现出新的推理能力</span></strong></li><li fid="uf21b2fc8" data-lake-id="u39d8e973" id="u39d8e973"><span data-lake-id="u5308f3eb" id="u5308f3eb">该模型（称为 DeepSeek-R1-Zero）自然发展出多样且复杂的推理行为。在解决推理问题时，模型倾向于生成更长的回答，并在每次回答中进行验证、反思以及对替代方法的探索。尽管作者没有明确教授模型如何推理，模型仍通过强化学习成功学会更好的推理策略</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u71d8db19" id="u71d8db19"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd36a06b" id="ucd36a06b">尽管 DeepSeek-R1-Zero 展现出出色的推理能力，但仍面临可读性较差和语言混杂等问题，有时会在同一次思维链回答中混用英语和中文</span></strong></p><ul list="uecd3a280"><li fid="u81989082" data-lake-id="u762935b2" id="u762935b2"><span data-lake-id="u69ea3836" id="u69ea3836">此外，DeepSeek-R1-Zero 基于规则的强化学习训练阶段局限于推理任务，导致其在写作和开放域问答等更广泛领域的表现有限</span></li><li fid="u81989082" data-lake-id="udd7d5f57" id="udd7d5f57"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufdb57946" id="ufdb57946" style="color: #AD1A2B">为应对这些挑战，作者提出 DeepSeek-R1。该模型通过融合拒绝采样、强化学习和监督微调的多阶段学习框架进行训练。这一训练流程使 DeepSeek-R1 能够继承前代模型 DeepSeek-R1-Zero 的推理能力，同时通过额外的非推理数据，使模型行为与人类偏好对齐</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="ZabUp" id="ZabUp" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua48c8d9b" id="ua48c8d9b">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="ub561d94c" id="ub561d94c" style="color: #AD1A2B"> </span><span data-lake-id="uf8f2121d" id="uf8f2121d">𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤-𝐑𝟏-𝐙𝐞𝐫𝐨</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u2689a8d5" id="u2689a8d5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u658c485d" id="u658c485d">DeepSeek-R1-Zero 的训练过程：该过程完全依赖强化学习，不进行监督微调。为提高大规模强化学习的效率，作者采用组相对策略优化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u81803bbf" id="u81803bbf"><span data-lake-id="u7a88dfee" id="u7a88dfee">GRPO 是作者用于训练 DeepSeek-R1-Zero 和 DeepSeek-R1 的强化学习算法。该算法旨在简化近端策略优化的训练流程并降低其资源消耗。PPO 广泛应用于大语言模型的强化学习阶段。对于每个问题</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LcPJu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u243576de" id="u243576de">，GRPO 从旧策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F619756aa1fc9995330d2f111c852dc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eP1C9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud36213f9" id="ud36213f9">中采样一组输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bo_1%2C%20o_2%2C%20%5C%5Cldots%2C%20o_G%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce15c0a206c7e788e6d5cf5b9fe49246.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rvAfw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u379f567f" id="u379f567f">，通过最大化以下目标来优化策略模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tKiGq%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua39660c5" id="ua39660c5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20P(Q)%2C%20%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(O%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7DA_i%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)A_i%5C%5Cright)-%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbb%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca20563fb1d25e87d7797b01a253618f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cg9OL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8717cbea" id="u8717cbea" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(o_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D-%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(o_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D-1.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb51fb6bef9bf04ed4113f8e8c66d1c36.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bSamT%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u74496e5c"><li fid="uf99fb780" data-lake-id="uc42c898d" id="uc42c898d"><span data-lake-id="udf3a9845" id="udf3a9845">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff73154893f2557c1227ee196e79412a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ycx20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u52792ba3" id="u52792ba3">为参考策略，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc57c5f0e31d8960d9406bb149fced9e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jMSnL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6aff4a7" id="ua6aff4a7">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iAyqK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc6185b8d" id="uc6185b8d">为超参数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2dc649a10f2cddc4f17e401268418402.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LlstH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89b7183a" id="u89b7183a">为优势值，由每组输出对应的一组奖励</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Br_1%2C%20r_2%2C%20%5C%5Cldots%2C%20r_G%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3784b63e4f9831cd6b7b95f8d94c2c59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22slJyl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c21da8d" id="u2c21da8d">计算得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u31b8bdff" id="u31b8bdff" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Br_i-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D(%5C%5C%7Br_1%2Cr_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cr_G%5C%5C%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstd%7D(%5C%5C%7Br_1%2Cr_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cr_G%5C%5C%7D)%7D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f2fa1996699c40d9178412adf4a65f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hz1wK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u411c1bcf"><li fid="u896738cc" data-lake-id="u7c1fcc41" id="u7c1fcc41"><span data-lake-id="u78b46c5e" id="u78b46c5e">在训练 DeepSeek-R1-Zero 时，作者将学习率设为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%223%20%5C%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fac25b8aa61dff23229eb31ad748f7253.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KlbsM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d5dbf71" id="u5d5dbf71">，KL 系数设为 0.001，rollout 的采样温度设为 1。对于每个问题，采样 16 个输出；在第 8,200 步之前，输出的最大长度为 32,768 个 token，之后则为 65,536 个 token</span></li><li fid="u896738cc" data-lake-id="u5b27442f" id="u5b27442f"><span data-lake-id="u31c967da" id="u31c967da">因此，DeepSeek-R1-Zero 的性能和回答长度在第 8,200 步出现显著跃升。训练总计进行 10,400 步，相当于 1.6 轮训练。每个训练步骤包含 32 个不同的问题，因此训练批大小为 512。每隔 400 步，作者将参考模型替换为最新的策略模型。为加速训练，每次 rollout 生成 8,192 个输出，将其随机划分为 16 个小批次，并仅进行 1 轮内部训练</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u25b1ce69" id="u25b1ce69"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0abb9d8e" id="u0abb9d8e">奖励是训练信号的来源，决定强化学习的优化方向。对于 DeepSeek-R1-Zero，作者采用基于规则的奖励，为数学、编程和逻辑推理领域的数据提供精确反馈。该规则奖励系统主要包含两类奖励：准确性奖励和格式奖励</span></strong></p><ul list="u9dfaebfb"><li fid="uae577396" data-lake-id="ua67e742d" id="ua67e742d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u721f346f" id="u721f346f">准确性奖励</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7e0b9139" id="u7e0b9139">用于评估回答是否正确。对于具有确定结果的数学问题，要求模型以指定格式给出最终答案，例如将答案置于方框内，从而能够基于规则可靠地验证答案的正确性。类似地，对于编程竞赛题目，可以使用编译器，依据一组预先定义的测试用例评估模型的回答，从而产生关于正确性的客观反馈。</span></li><li fid="uae577396" data-lake-id="uc68f8714" id="uc68f8714"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud52e5796" id="ud52e5796">格式奖励</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud0ab6716" id="ud0ab6716">通过施加特定的格式要求，对准确性奖励模型形成补充。模型被激励将推理过程包含在指定标签内，即</span><code data-lake-id="ub5abb0a6" id="ub5abb0a6"><span data-lake-id="u91f1bf74" id="u91f1bf74">&lt;think&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id="u3f06d33d" id="u3f06d33d">和</span><code data-lake-id="u2d7a46ef" id="u2d7a46ef"><span data-lake-id="u9a6976d4" id="u9a6976d4">&lt;/think&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id="ubb180b82" id="ubb180b82">。这使模型的思考过程得以明确界定，增强可解释性，并有助于后续分析</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua66c2dbb" id="ua66c2dbb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brule%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bacc%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bformat%7D%7D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F45cadad372de9048ce1d445c56a364b5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pESPI%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u9eaa5c01"><li fid="u483f4b88" data-lake-id="u16e3fe55" id="u16e3fe55"><span data-lake-id="ua38f2b33" id="ua38f2b33">准确性奖励与格式奖励以相同权重组合。未在推理任务中使用神经奖励模型，无论是基于结果的奖励模型，还是基于过程的奖励模型。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u863fb02d" id="u863fb02d" style="color: #5C0036">这一决定源于以下观察：在大规模强化学习过程中，神经奖励模型容易受到奖励投机的影响。此外，重新训练此类模型需要大量计算资源，并会增加训练流程的复杂性，从而使整体优化过程更加复杂</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9a555c14" id="u9a555c14"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5d172e79" id="u5d172e79">作者在 DeepSeek-V3 基础模型上应用强化学习技术，训练 DeepSeek-R1-Zero。在训练过程中，作者设计一个简单直接的模板，要求 DeepSeek-R1-Zero 先生成推理过程，再给出最终答案。作者有意将约束限制在这一结构化格式上，避免引入任何针对具体内容的偏置，以确保能够准确观察模型在强化学习过程中的自然发展</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9a2c0f3d" id="u9a2c0f3d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790644952082-4a3b92fd-69bd-4126-b494-d6bed1b96ab3.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u93b7c118-a32e-420e-9211-a60baf27213%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u34d7f52d-e7d9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A757.5999755859375%2C%22height%22%3A278%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A143739%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1282%2C%22originHeight%22%3A471%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK-R1-ZEROALMEACCURACYDURINGTRAINI%22%2C%22x%22%3A144%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A349%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TVR%22%2C%22x%22%3A234%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A210%2C%22height%22%3A-24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22x%22%3A94%2C%22y%22%3A256%2C%22width%22%3A385%2C%22height%22%3A-69%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22--HUMANPARTICIPANTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A74%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HNN%22%2C%22x%22%3A775%2C%22y%22%3A366%2C%22width%22%3A381%2C%22height%22%3A-97%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1-ZERO-CONS%4016%22%2C%22x%22%3A86%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1-ZERO-PASS%401%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A143%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK-R1-ZER%22%2C%22x%22%3A767%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A793%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A269%2C%22height%22%3A-58%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EROAVERAGELENGTHPERRESP%22%2C%22x%22%3A876%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A201%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210000%22%2C%22x%22%3A556%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228000%22%2C%22x%22%3A461%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2212500%22%2C%22x%22%3A667%2C%22y%22%3A177%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224000%22%2C%22x%22%3A256%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A967%2C%22y%22%3A442%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A311%2C%22y%22%3A440%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210000%22%2C%22x%22%3A1212%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224000%22%2C%22x%22%3A914%2C%22y%22%3A427%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226000%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A426%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22x%22%3A110%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A71%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222000%22%2C%22x%22%3A149%2C%22y%22%3A426%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220000%22%2C%22x%22%3A675%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2215000%22%2C%22x%22%3A662%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228000%22%2C%22x%22%3A1084%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222000%22%2C%22x%22%3A808%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A7%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A208%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A72%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226000%22%2C%22x%22%3A976%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%BF%22%2C%22x%22%3A651%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22750%22%2C%22x%22%3A677%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221000%22%2C%22x%22%3A666%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A13%2C%22height%22%3A57%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225000%22%2C%22x%22%3A673%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22----HU%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f7f7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u72fc982d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua4d444a9"><li fid="u4cae6710" data-lake-id="uf0fe8de1" id="uf0fe8de1"><span data-lake-id="ud23786c3" id="ud23786c3">DeepSeek-R1-Zero 的思考时间在整个训练过程中稳步增加，这一变化完全由模型的内在适应驱动，而非外部修改。借助长思维链，模型逐步完善其推理过程，生成数百至数千个 token，以探索并改进问题求解策略</span></li><li fid="u4cae6710" data-lake-id="u89ffe2a4" id="u89ffe2a4"><span data-lake-id="uc0094405" id="uc0094405">思考时间的增加促进复杂行为的自主形成。具体而言，DeepSeek-R1-Zero 越来越多地表现出反思性推理、系统性探索替代解决方案等高级推理策略。这些策略显著提高模型在数学和编程等可验证任务上的表现</span></li><li fid="u4cae6710" data-lake-id="u0c4b11e1" id="u0c4b11e1"><span data-lake-id="ueae17411" id="ueae17411">值得注意的是，在训练过程中，DeepSeek-R1-Zero 出现一个 顿悟时刻（aha moment），其特征是在反思过程中使用 wait 一词的频率突然增加。这一时刻标志着推理模式发生明显变化，并清楚地展现 DeepSeek-R1-Zero 的自我演化过程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud4a2ca5d" id="ud4a2ca5d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd39a7f8" id="ucd39a7f8" style="color: #AD1A2B">DeepSeek-R1-Zero 的自我演化凸显强化学习的力量与魅力：作者仅为模型提供适当的激励，模型便自主发展出高级问题求解策略，而无需明确教授其如何解决问题。这表明，强化学习具有释放大语言模型更高层次能力的潜力，为未来更加自主且更具适应性的模型铺平道路</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="QgzZJ" id="QgzZJ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u876f5b2c" id="u876f5b2c">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="ueef5ddee" id="ueef5ddee" style="color: #AD1A2B"> </span><span data-lake-id="ub165b3eb" id="ub165b3eb">𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤-𝐑𝟏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uad03d71d" id="uad03d71d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u423e49be" id="u423e49be">由于 DeepSeek-V3-Base 使用多种语言进行训练，尤其是英语和中文，DeepSeek-R1-Zero 存在可读性较差和语言混杂等问题。为解决这些问题，作者开发 DeepSeek-R1，其训练流程如图所示</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9212582a" id="u9212582a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790645444837-9ac3cfde-83b3-4600-a1aa-af334f0d22d0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4dc3336d-aea1-4bb8-8d54-b33284160fb%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7d7a817a-7a3a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A779.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A372%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A107180%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1304%2C%22originHeight%22%3A622%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22POST-PROCESSING%22%2C%22x%22%3A1101%2C%22y%22%3A435%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COLDSTARTLONGCOT%22%2C%22x%22%3A355%2C%22y%22%3A176%2C%22width%22%3A194%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACCURACY%26FORMAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A199%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PREFERENCEREWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A778%2C%22y%22%3A480%2C%22width%22%3A200%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAININGALGORITHMS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1103%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROMPTS%2BRESPONSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1097%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RULE-BASEDREWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A454%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REASONINGPROMPTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A356%2C%22y%22%3A396%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REASONINGPROMPTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A190%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%26LANG.CONSISTENCY%22%2C%22x%22%3A356%2C%22y%22%3A480%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RULE-BASEDREWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A782%2C%22y%22%3A455%2C%22width%22%3A192%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REASONINGPROMPTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A422%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DIVERSEPROMPTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A788%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NON-REASONING%22%2C%22x%22%3A798%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V3BASE%22%2C%22x%22%3A408%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK%22%2C%22x%22%3A610%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REASONING%22%2C%22x%22%3A818%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROMPTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1099%2C%22y%22%3A337%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK%22%2C%22x%22%3A829%2C%22y%22%3A554%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK%22%2C%22x%22%3A823%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1096%2C%22y%22%3A189%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V3%2BHUMAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A122%2C%22y%22%3A505%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK%22%2C%22x%22%3A402%2C%22y%22%3A552%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V3BASE%22%2C%22x%22%3A827%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEER%22%2C%22x%22%3A401%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CCURACY%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A481%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK%22%2C%22x%22%3A400%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REWARDS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1098%2C%22y%22%3A386%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK%22%2C%22x%22%3A67%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1DEV-3%22%2C%22x%22%3A827%2C%22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORMAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A504%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK%22%2C%22x%22%3A125%2C%22y%22%3A480%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK%22%2C%22x%22%3A70%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1DEV-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A405%2C%22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEH%22%2C%22x%22%3A825%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1DEV-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A405%2C%22y%22%3A577%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1ZERO%22%2C%22x%22%3A79%2C%22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A130%2C%22y%22%3A349%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A664%2C%22y%22%3A177%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V3BASE%22%2C%22x%22%3A75%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FILTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A453%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SFT%22%2C%22x%22%3A841%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REFINE%22%2C%22x%22%3A125%2C%22y%22%3A454%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SFT%22%2C%22x%22%3A397%2C%22y%22%3A143%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V3%22%2C%22x%22%3A626%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1%22%2C%22x%22%3A841%2C%22y%22%3A579%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RL%22%2C%22x%22%3A832%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e4e5f4%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0dad965c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="u91f7a50b"><li fid="ub155166a" data-lake-id="u86ad1c9e" id="u86ad1c9e"><span data-lake-id="ucac9a6cc" id="ucac9a6cc">在初始阶段，作者收集数千条冷启动数据，这些数据呈现出对话式、与人类对齐的思考过程。随后，通过强化学习训练，在采用对话式思考过程并保持语言一致性的同时提升模型性能</span></li><li fid="ub155166a" data-lake-id="u5f838cdd" id="u5f838cdd"><span data-lake-id="u18310fbc" id="u18310fbc">之后，再次进行拒绝采样和监督微调（SFT）。这一阶段将推理和非推理数据集共同纳入 SFT 过程，使模型不仅能够在推理任务上表现出色，还能展现出较强的写作能力。为进一步使模型与人类偏好对齐，作者实施第二阶段的强化学习，旨在增强模型的有用性和无害性，同时进一步完善其推理能力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub25b80b4" id="ub25b80b4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u765c5f10" id="u765c5f10" style="color: #4C16B1">对于通用数据，作者使用奖励模型捕捉复杂且细微情境下的人类偏好。作者以 DeepSeek-V3 的流程为基础，对偏好样本对和训练提示采用类似的分布。在有用性方面，仅关注最终总结，确保评估侧重于回答对用户的实用性和相关性，同时尽量减少对推理过程本身的干扰。在无害性方面，则评估模型的完整回答，包括推理过程和总结，以识别并缓解可能出现的潜在风险、偏见或有害内容</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u822dd758" id="u822dd758"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6efe7715" id="u6efe7715">有用性奖励模型。在有用性奖励模型的训练中，作者首先使用 arena-hard 提示格式，通过提示 DeepSeek-V3 生成偏好样本对。每个样本对包含一个用户查询及两个候选回答</span></strong></p><ul list="u3b3ebfdf"><li fid="u4c2d4708" data-lake-id="udc78dceb" id="udc78dceb"><span data-lake-id="ucedb3bc6" id="ucedb3bc6">对于每个偏好样本对，作者调用 DeepSeek-V3 进行 4 次评判，并随机将候选回答分配为 Response A 或 Response B，以减轻位置偏差。最终偏好分数通过对 4 次独立评判取平均得到，仅保留分数差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbe179fa77b5a6af5c84309f72dd808.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JeHFY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub63edb63" id="ub63edb63">大于 1 的样本对，以确保两者具有有意义的差异</span></li><li fid="u4c2d4708" data-lake-id="uafdecf55" id="uafdecf55"><span data-lake-id="u8f628361" id="u8f628361">为尽量减少与长度相关的偏差，作者确保整个数据集中被选中回答与被拒绝回答的长度具有可比性。最终，共整理 66,000 组数据对，用于训练奖励模型。该数据集中的提示均为非推理问题，来源为公开可用的开源数据集，或已明确同意为模型改进而共享数据的用户。奖励模型架构与 DeepSeek-R1 一致，并额外增加一个用于预测标量偏好分数的奖励头</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u36768f92" id="u36768f92" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhelpful%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhelpful%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathrm%7BResponse%7D_A%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7BResponse%7D_B)%20%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd92b4adc60237a0977e44455042262de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IT8KT%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5540b2a9"><li fid="uc4a7e1b3" data-lake-id="u51810d28" id="u51810d28"><span data-lake-id="uec611547" id="uec611547">有用性奖励模型的训练批大小为 256，学习率为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%226%20%5C%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb0888bf94a7d586339572096f8e964bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zo1jM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0468684" id="uc0468684">，在训练数据集上训练 1 轮。训练期间的最大序列长度设为 8,192 个 token，而在奖励模型推理期间不施加明确的长度限制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u954c485c" id="u954c485c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue5b27139" id="ue5b27139">安全性奖励模型。为评估并提升模型的安全性，作者整理一个包含 106,000 个提示的数据集，其中模型生成的回答依据预先定义的安全准则，被标注为安全或不安全。与有用性奖励模型采用的成对损失不同，安全性奖励模型采用逐点方法训练，以区分安全回答和不安全回答。其训练超参数与有用性奖励模型相同</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u44e8ae06" id="u44e8ae06" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsafety%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRM%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsafety%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathrm%7BResponse%7D)%20%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3ad456ea6d182e40a289f108f6cc4942.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aSz5s%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u95e85741" id="u95e85741"><strong><span data-lake-id="u19b097e7" id="u19b097e7">对于通用查询，每个样本均被归入安全性数据集或有用性数据集之一。分配给每个查询的通用奖励</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGeneral%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe089aa224bdab3dd4f425aaec6d188b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E8PKh%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubfda123b" id="ubfda123b">，对应于其所属数据集中定义的相应奖励</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9491836f" id="u9491836f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2cf14757" id="u2cf14757" style="color: #DF2A3F">在第一阶段强化学习中，</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0a8d41bd" id="u0a8d41bd">作者将学习率设为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%223%20%5C%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fac25b8aa61dff23229eb31ad748f7253.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OWDOD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d37fc46" id="u3d37fc46">，KL 系数设为 0.001，GRPO 裁剪比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc57c5f0e31d8960d9406bb149fced9e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E0WIx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3cfa067" id="ua3cfa067">设为 10，rollout 的采样温度设为 1。对于每个问题，采样 16 个输出，最大长度为 32,768</span></p><ul list="u5986b5ec"><li fid="u1572fcc0" data-lake-id="ude81c910" id="ude81c910"><span data-lake-id="u4dfb5005" id="u4dfb5005">每个训练步骤包含 32 个不同的问题，因此每步的训练批大小为 512。每隔 400 步，作者将参考模型替换为最新的策略模型。为加速训练，每次 rollout 生成 8,192 个输出，将其随机划分为 16 个小批次，并仅进行 1 轮内部训练。不过，为缓解语言混杂问题，作者在强化学习训练期间引入语言一致性奖励，其计算方式为 CoT 中目标语言词语所占的比例</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2336c705" id="u2336c705" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blanguage%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BNum%7D(%5C%5Cmathrm%7BWords%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btarget%7D%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BNum%7D(%5C%5Cmathrm%7BWords%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55ac27a728b0c34b20ff88119fcadb8b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WmpkG%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc2bb8b0e"><li fid="u2efdf805" data-lake-id="u374f2c42" id="u374f2c42"><span data-lake-id="u028ba15b" id="u028ba15b">这种对齐会导致模型性能略有下降，但该奖励符合人类偏好，使模型输出更具可读性。作者将语言一致性奖励直接加到最终奖励中，并将其同时应用于推理和非推理数据</span></li><li fid="u2efdf805" data-lake-id="u142e142f" id="u142e142f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2507caaf" id="u2507caaf" style="color: #AD1A2B">裁剪比率在训练中起着关键作用。较低的取值可能导致大量 token 的梯度被截断，从而降低模型性能；较高的取值则可能造成训练不稳定</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf33e2da9" id="uf33e2da9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub53518a1" id="ub53518a1" style="color: #DF2A3F">第二阶段强化学习</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3f125fe6" id="u3f125fe6">，作者结合多种奖励信号与多样化的提示分布来训练模型。对于推理数据，沿用 DeepSeek-R1-Zero 中的方法，使用基于规则的奖励指导数学、编程和逻辑推理领域的学习。在训练过程中，作者观察到 CoT 经常出现语言混杂，尤其是在强化学习提示涉及多种语言时。对于通用数据，则使用奖励模型指导训练。最终，奖励信号与多样化数据分布的结合，使模型不仅在推理方面表现出色，也注重有用性和无害性。给定一批数据，其奖励可表示为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u170b0e3f" id="u170b0e3f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Breasoning%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bgeneral%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blanguage%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6580b4b153803e93f29993be3215fc9b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ECrjE%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7a0b6ccc" id="u7a0b6ccc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Breasoning%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brule%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b734c6e34918f091ee8887598d32964.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ABbhW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua883aa57" id="ua883aa57" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bgeneral%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Breward%5C%5C_model%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BReward%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bformat%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe1f2d2ea25a9441e22c777a464f5f49c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xOXoc%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucc0d4699"><li fid="u87781ae6" data-lake-id="u507a3ec3" id="u507a3ec3"><span data-lake-id="ud0d3da10" id="ud0d3da10">第二阶段强化学习保留第一阶段的大部分参数设置，主要区别是将温度降至 0.7，因为作者发现，在这一阶段使用较高温度会导致生成内容不连贯</span></li><li fid="u87781ae6" data-lake-id="u53619c13" id="u53619c13"><span data-lake-id="u49179528" id="u49179528">该阶段共包含 1,700 个训练步骤，其中通用指令数据和基于偏好的奖励仅在最后 400 步中引入。作者发现，增加使用基于模型的偏好奖励信号进行训练的步数，可能导致奖励投机</span></li></ul>